10 REM THE DAYS IN A MONTH OF THE GREGORIAN CALENDAR, 28 TO 31. FEBRUARY
11 REM HAS 29 IN A YEAR DIVISIBLE BY 4, EXCEPT A CENTURY NOT DIVISIBLE BY
12 REM 400. A NUMBER HERE HOLDS 18 DIGITS, SO A YEAR UP TO
13 REM 999999999999999999 IS KEPT; BELOW 1, OR A MONTH OUTSIDE 1 TO 12,
14 REM IS REFUSED.
20 INPUT Y, M
30 IF Y < 1 THEN 300
40 IF Y > 999999999999999999 THEN 300
50 IF M < 1 THEN 300
60 IF M > 12 THEN 300
70 LET N = M + INT(M / 8)
80 LET L = 30 + N - INT(N / 2) * 2
90 IF M <> 2 THEN 200
100 LET L = 28
110 IF Y - INT(Y / 4) * 4 <> 0 THEN 200
120 LET L = 29
130 IF Y - INT(Y / 100) * 100 <> 0 THEN 200
140 IF Y - INT(Y / 400) * 400 = 0 THEN 200
150 LET L = 28
200 PRINT L
210 GOTO 310
300 PRINT "REFUSED"
310 END
